cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Fieldmark (built on FAIMS)
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Fieldmark is open-source software for offline-capable field data
  collection. Researchers design a notebook in a browser, collect records
  on Android, iOS, or the web with no network, and sync when a connection
  returns. Records carry a full version history, and export includes CSV,
  GeoJSON, KML, GeoPackage, attachments, and an RO-Crate metadata file.
  Fieldmark is the current generation of the FAIMS platform, and this
  repository, FAIMS3, is its source. Work published before 2024 generally
  names the software FAIMS or FAIMS Mobile.
